      "id": "question-01",
      "intent": "question",
      "lessonKey": "ai-prompting-iteration",
      "message": "Why is adding context better than just making the prompt longer?",
      "blockId": "aiess-l09-b054",
      "output": "Context and length are different things. A long prompt with vague instructions wastes tokens and confuses the model; a short prompt with clear role, task, and constraints focuses it on what matters. Which part of your prompts tends to get fuzzy, the goal itself, or the limits on how the model should answer?",
